  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "text": "Steve Anderson's black color umbrella shows not deliverable to my location; hence, I cannot place an order. Issue with products showing undeliverable on pincode.",
      "source": "PissedConsumer",
      "source_id": "pc_p8_1314905",
      "date": "2026-08-17",
      "confidence": 0.94,
      "tags": [
        "pincode_unserviceable"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "The product details on the app specified a 'regular fit,' but I received a 'relaxed fit' in a completely different color. Now, when I try to return this incorrect item, the app is charging me a ₹50 return processing fee.",
      "source": "Play Store",
      "source_id": "205ad5f3-2687-47ba-a505-f60bd3b42e3b",
      "date": "2026-08-13",
      "confidence": 0.92,
      "tags": [
        "return_fee_friction"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "I have purchased it, and after 4 to 5 days, the product is very poor quality. It is not a branded product. The shoe box is not branded; there is local paper inside it, and it is very yellowish in color.",
      "source": "PissedConsumer",
      "source_id": "pc_p17_1210232",
      "date": "2026-08-17",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "tags": [
        "authenticity_doubts"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "I have ordered a denim skirt in navy blue color with a 32 waist size, which was tight on me, so I have exchanged it for a 34 size but received it in a different blue shade. Now my size has gone in the app.",
      "source": "PissedConsumer",
      "source_id": "pc_p12_2412503",
      "date": "2026-08-17",
      "confidence": 0.88,
      "tags": [
        "size_stock_out"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "They have delivered a Levis Jean instead of Mango with same order ID collected the cas of Rs 2832. Obviously it is some fraud where they are collecting money giving wrong item because u cant open parcel before payment.",
      "source": "PissedConsumer",
      "source_id": "pc_p26_4937672",
      "date": "2026-08-17",
      "confidence": 0.87,
      "tags": [
        "wrong_item_delivery"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    }
  ],
